{"id":"en_blood-atonement","title":"BLOOD & ATONEMENT","titleEn":"BLOOD & ATONEMENT","description":"Orphaned Ella takes shelter in a vampire castle during a violent storm, where she encounters Lord Valen, a man gripped by wild energy beyond his control. Only Ella's uncommon ancient bloodline has the power to calm him. Their forbidden love across species begins to bloom, but an ambitious Prince Lord fabricates spy letters to tear them apart, and a suspicious Valen harshly sends Ella back to the human world. After Lord rises in rebellion, Valen defeats it and uncovers the scheme, then rushes to the human city filled with regret. Following a year of gentle care, Ella recovers and comes back with Valen, who rewrites the old laws and offers her vow rings again, pledging themselves to each other forever. Those who wish to follow the series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/blood-and-atonement/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/blood-and-atonement/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hybrid","Second Chance","Vampire","Forbidden","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7l6q/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_blood-atonement_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7l6q/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_blood-atonement_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7l6q/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_blood-atonement_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7l6q/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},